<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
We believe a great journey starts with a great booking experience, so I’m sorry to hear about the<em><strong> -error with your booking/give details here-</strong></em> and the impact that this had on your flight to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
We’ve always been committed to providing customers with a premium, professional and helpful service, so I understand your disappointment on this occasion.<br />
<br />
I understand your decision to purchase a new ticket to get you on your way and would be happy to look at reimbursing this for you. I’ve attached a form for you to provide your bank account details so that we can process any refund.<br />
<br />
When returning the completed form and any supporting documentation, please reply directly to this email. This will make sure the information is attached to your current file.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-if a frequent flyer</strong></em><br />
<br />
In the meantime, as a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<em><strong>&nbsp;-if not a Frequent Flyer</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with an exceptional experience from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed on your feedback to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and I hope we deliver an exceptional service next time you fly with Qantas.</body>
